WEBVTT

00:24.830 --> 00:26.330
<b>We've received intel that
the Living Dead Division's battle</b>

00:26.370 --> 00:29.000
<b>has spread from Banchi 3 to Banchi 2.</b>

00:29.040 --> 00:30.450
<b>- Tell all the reinforcements!</b>

00:30.500 --> 00:31.580
<b>- Roger that!</b>

00:39.660 --> 00:42.330
<b>Daryl... Guys...</b>

00:42.370 --> 00:45.790
<b>Hold out until these reinforcements arrive.</b>

01:15.620 --> 01:18.330
<b>Damn it, die already!</b>

01:25.660 --> 01:27.660
<b>Karla, this is amazing!</b>

01:27.700 --> 01:33.410
<b>This mobile suit you built for me is way better than
the arms and legs I lost!</b>

01:34.830 --> 01:38.830
<b>The enemy flagship is dead in space
from a friendly mobile suit force attack.</b>

01:38.870 --> 01:41.660
<b>Multiple Zeon troops
are still alive inside.</b>

01:41.700 --> 01:44.160
<b>We are en route to board
and take the enemy ship.</b>

01:44.200 --> 01:45.540
<b>Take the ship?</b>

01:45.580 --> 01:48.290
<b>This lifeboat doesn't have enough oxygen.</b>

01:50.660 --> 01:52.330
<b>Chief Petty Officer Chiba
will take point in a Ball.</b>

01:58.660 --> 02:01.160
<b>- Cornelius, you ever shoot anyone?</b>

02:01.200 --> 02:02.330
<b>- No.</b>

02:03.000 --> 02:04.080
<b>I finally understand why he wants</b>

02:04.120 --> 02:07.040
<b>to listen to music in battle.</b>

03:08.370 --> 03:10.830
<b>I can do this...
I can take him!</b>

03:19.950 --> 03:21.580
<b>The engine room's that way.</b>

03:21.620 --> 03:23.870
<b>Take your men and secure Engineering.</b>

03:23.910 --> 03:25.250
<b>- But we're just mechanics...</b>

03:25.290 --> 03:26.870
<b>- You've had training!</b>

03:28.080 --> 03:29.330
<b>Roger that.</b>

03:45.040 --> 03:46.370
<b>There's air.</b>

03:46.410 --> 03:49.160
<b>They must be up where
this music is coming from.</b>

04:01.370 --> 04:03.660
<b>Thank you, Prof. Karla.</b>

04:03.700 --> 04:07.000
<b>This explosion should spread
through the entire ship.</b>

04:07.040 --> 04:11.040
<b>Let's take them all with us
and put an end to this nightmare.</b>

04:12.160 --> 04:14.450
<b>Freeze! All of you,
stay where you are!</b>

04:14.500 --> 04:18.450
<b>We're the Earth Federation Forces
Moore Brotherhood!</b>

04:18.500 --> 04:20.330
<b>This ship is under our control!</b>

04:20.370 --> 04:22.000
<b>Surrender yourselves peacefully!</b>

04:22.040 --> 04:24.450
<b>Is the person in charge here?</b>

04:24.500 --> 04:26.500
<b>Who's the ranking officer?!</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:37.790
<b>No Zeon soldier would live with
the disgrace of being taken prisoner.</b>

04:37.830 --> 04:41.370
<b>He's right! It's a matter of
a soldier's honor and pride! Never!</b>

04:44.250 --> 04:46.500
<b>Die, Gundam!</b>

04:47.790 --> 04:51.660
<b>Daryl, I won't let you die alone.</b>

04:52.250 --> 04:53.450
<b>I'll join you.</b>

04:54.620 --> 04:56.700
<b>This will kill you!</b>

05:02.540 --> 05:03.620
<b>Let's do this.</b>

05:04.290 --> 05:05.750
<b>- Sieg- -
- Wait!</b>

05:20.160 --> 05:21.870
<b>This has to end!</b>

05:21.910 --> 05:25.370
<b>How long is the hatred
and killing going to go on?</b>

05:25.870 --> 05:29.660
<b>It has to end.
This... has to end.</b>

05:32.450 --> 05:35.700
<b>All of you, come here!
Get a move on!</b>

05:35.750 --> 05:37.750
<b>Why hasn't there been an explosion?</b>

05:37.790 --> 05:39.500
<b>Maybe they failed...</b>

05:39.540 --> 05:42.000
<b>Plan B. Switch to Plan B.</b>

05:42.040 --> 05:44.330
<b>Blowing yourselves up is pointless!
This has to stop.</b>

05:44.370 --> 05:45.870
<b>We won't be taken prisoner!</b>

05:45.910 --> 05:48.000
<b>We'll take you out with us!</b>

05:48.040 --> 05:50.160
<b>- You took our families and loved ones!</b>

05:50.200 --> 05:52.120
<b>- You'll feel our hatred!</b>

05:52.160 --> 05:55.000
<b>We've endured plenty of suffering ourselves!</b>

05:55.540 --> 05:58.870
<b>This sector is where
our colonies used to be!</b>

05:58.910 --> 06:00.950
<b>It's where our homeland was!</b>

06:01.000 --> 06:02.080
<b>- Homeland?</b>

06:02.120 --> 06:03.870
<b>- They're from Side 4?</b>

06:03.910 --> 06:05.290
<b>That's right.</b>

06:05.330 --> 06:08.500
<b>Our home was taken,
our mothership was destroyed,</b>

06:08.540 --> 06:10.870
<b>and now there's only
a handful of us left!</b>

06:10.910 --> 06:13.830
<b>I don't want to see
any more of us die!</b>

06:13.870 --> 06:16.540
<b>Let's figure out a way
to survive this together!</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:19.330
<b>Fighting until we're both wiped out</b>

06:19.370 --> 06:20.750
<b>is just stupid!</b>

06:22.790 --> 06:24.290
<b>What are you- -</b>

06:48.660 --> 06:49.580
<b>- It worked!</b>

06:49.620 --> 06:51.250
<b>- It was a longshot, but it worked!</b>

07:07.290 --> 07:09.120
<b>This thing's built tough, all right.</b>

07:09.160 --> 07:11.750
<b>If I ditch the extra armor,
I can still fight!</b>

07:22.290 --> 07:25.620
<b>I'm gonna put an end to this.
I'll kill him.</b>

07:35.950 --> 07:38.370
<b>Hurry up!
We can't hold them off!</b>

07:43.700 --> 07:45.370
<b>Sieg Zeon!</b>

07:48.500 --> 07:51.000
<b>Oh, come on! Not after we made it
all the way to the magazine!</b>

08:39.500 --> 08:42.620
<b>When you hear my jazz,
that's when you die!</b>

08:43.580 --> 08:44.830
<b>Peglegs!</b>

09:37.370 --> 09:40.990
<b>Why?! Why can't I beat him?!</b>

09:42.280 --> 09:43.820
<b>I get it now, Karla.</b>

09:45.040 --> 09:48.870
<b>When I met you,
that was my miracle.</b>

10:38.910 --> 10:40.370
<b>No way!</b>

10:40.410 --> 10:42.200
<b>He's missing all his limbs?</b>

10:42.250 --> 10:45.830
<b>I lost to a guy like this?!</b>

11:50.290 --> 11:53.370
<b>I see. Claudia isn't with you?</b>

11:54.040 --> 11:57.290
<b>She was the ship's captain,
so she probably...</b>

12:12.370 --> 12:13.750
<b>Thanks.</b>

12:13.790 --> 12:16.000
<b>The reinforcements
you brought saved us, Fisher.</b>

12:16.040 --> 12:18.830
<b>No, I just did it without thinking.</b>

12:19.580 --> 12:22.870
<b>We lost the Psycho Zaku, though.</b>

12:23.870 --> 12:25.290
<b>How do we report this?</b>

12:26.330 --> 12:28.330
<b>When Prof. Karla recovers,</b>

12:28.370 --> 12:31.250
<b>the Reuse Psycho Device will be mass-produced.</b>

12:31.290 --> 12:33.620
<b>More pilots will probably decide</b>

12:33.660 --> 12:34.660
<b>to take on the same fate as you.</b>

12:35.750 --> 12:37.790
<b>Yeah, the Reuse Psycho Device can turn</b>

12:37.830 --> 12:41.200
<b>even average pilots into supermen.</b>

12:42.700 --> 12:46.330
<b>They only have to cut off their limbs.
Just like I did.</b>

12:49.290 --> 12:51.830
<b>That's enough, Living Dead Division!</b>

12:51.870 --> 12:53.830
<b>Torture is a treaty violation!</b>

12:53.870 --> 12:56.700
<b>As a Special Service member,
I can no longer turn a blind eye.</b>

12:58.120 --> 13:01.250
<b>We understand, sir.
Our apologies.</b>

13:02.540 --> 13:03.620
<b>Go ahead.</b>

13:03.660 --> 13:04.910
<b>You have five minutes.</b>

13:04.950 --> 13:08.040
<b>Audio and video will be recorded.</b>

13:08.080 --> 13:09.370
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:12.250 --> 13:13.830
<b>Io Fleming...</b>

13:14.410 --> 13:16.660
<b>Son of the former leader of Side 4.</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:20.200
<b>Attached to the Earth Federation Forces'
Moore Brotherhood.</b>

13:20.250 --> 13:24.200
<b>And notorious Gundam pilot.</b>

13:28.040 --> 13:31.040
<b>Daryl Lorenz...</b>

13:31.080 --> 13:32.790
<b>C'mon, tell me.</b>

13:32.830 --> 13:35.580
<b>How do you pilot a mobile suit</b>

13:35.620 --> 13:38.790
<b>with that pathetic,
crippled body of yours?</b>

13:39.830 --> 13:42.580
<b>I wanted to put an end
to this by killing you.</b>

13:43.500 --> 13:45.080
<b>I thought if I could defeat the Gundam,</b>

13:45.790 --> 13:48.950
<b>it would set me free from
the nightmare of war.</b>

13:49.000 --> 13:50.540
<b>Nightmare?</b>

13:53.080 --> 13:55.700
<b>You're playing the victim
after all you've done?</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:58.700
<b>You beat my Gundam with
power you gained</b>

13:58.750 --> 14:01.040
<b>by offering up your body
to your mobile suit.</b>

14:01.080 --> 14:03.120
<b>Helluva rush, isn't it?</b>

14:03.160 --> 14:08.120
<b>Even as we curse war, we become
more and more obsessed with it.</b>

14:10.410 --> 14:14.500
<b>It's our fate to go on fighting.</b>

14:20.250 --> 14:24.500
<b>This war isn't going to end just yet.</b>
